config XM_POWER_SUPPLY
	tristate "Xiaomi MCA charging stack"
	depends on QTI_PMIC_GLINK
	depends on QCOM_SMEM
	depends on QCOM_PANEL_EVENT_NOTIFIER
	depends on MI_HARDWARE_ID
	depends on QTI_BATTERY_CHARGER=n
	help
	  Xiaomi's Mi Charging Architecture (MCA), the charging stack of
	  Xiaomi phones whose battery charger runs on the ADSP: platform
	  class drivers, charging strategies, the battery and charger power
	  supplies, and the drivers for the BQ27Z561 fuel gauge, the SC8581
	  charge pump and the NU1652 wireless receiver.

	  The stack replaces the QTI battery charger client on the same PMIC
	  Glink channel and exports the battery charger interface in its
	  place, so the two cannot be enabled together.

	  All parts are built as separate modules, named as on the stock
	  firmware.
